 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "外部调用的第三种后果，是拒绝服务。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用的第三种后果，是拒绝服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "攻击者不偷钱，而是让合约的某个功能，长期用不了。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不偷钱，而是让合约的某个功能，长期用不了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.756,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 5.854,
   "speechEnd": 9.866
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "再猜一道题。拍卖合约收到新出价时，把钱直接退给上一位出价者。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。拍卖合约收到新出价时，把钱直接退给上一位出价者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.92,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 11.018,
   "speechEnd": 16.622
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "上一位出价者是一个合约，它的 receive 函数总是回滚。",
   "spoken": "上一位出价者是一个合约，它的 receive 函数总是回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.692,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 17.79,
   "speechEnd": 21.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "新出价能成功吗？",
   "spoken": "新出价能成功吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.88,
   "dur": 2.352,
   "speechStart": 22.978,
   "speechEnd": 24.406
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "不能。退款失败，让整笔新出价回滚。",
   "spoken": "不能。退款失败，让整笔新出价回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.732,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 25.83,
   "speechEnd": 29.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "它会一直占着最高出价者的位置。",
   "spoken": "它会一直占着最高出价者的位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.608,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 30.706,
   "speechEnd": 33.408
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "换成快递：100 个包裹，要按顺序送完。",
   "spoken": "换成快递：100 个包裹，要按顺序送完。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.476,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 34.574,
   "speechEnd": 38.038
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第 1 个被拒收，后面 99 个都送不出去。",
   "spoken": "第 1 个被拒收，后面 99 个都送不出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.088,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 39.186,
   "speechEnd": 42.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "修复是拉取式支付。合约只记账，收款人自己来取。",
   "spoken": "修复是拉取式支付。合约只记账，收款人自己来取。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.244,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 43.342,
   "speechEnd": 47.815
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "一个人拒收，只影响他自己。",
   "spoken": "一个人拒收，只影响他自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.888,
   "dur": 3.072,
   "speechStart": 48.986,
   "speechEnd": 51.14
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "类似的毛病，还有几种。",
   "spoken": "类似的毛病，还有几种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.18,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 52.278,
   "speechEnd": 54.159
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "遍历所有用户发奖励。用户一多，就超过区块 gas 上限。",
   "spoken": "遍历所有用户发奖励。用户一多，就超过区块 gas 上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 55.208,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 55.306,
   "speechEnd": 59.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "改成分页，或者用累计奖励因子。",
   "spoken": "改成分页，或者用垒计奖励因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 61.068,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 61.166,
   "speechEnd": 63.844
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "批量分发 USDT，其中一个地址被冻结，整批失败。",
   "spoken": "批亮分发 USDT，其中一个地址被冻结，整批失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 64.912,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 65.01,
   "speechEnd": 69.748
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "改成逐个捕获失败，记账，等对方来领。",
   "spoken": "改成逐个捕获失败，记账，等对方来领。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 70.82,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 70.918,
   "speechEnd": 74.239
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "要求余额严格等于记录值。被人强制转入 1 wei，就再也对不上。",
   "spoken": "要求余额严格等于记录值。被人强制转入 1 wei，就再也对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 75.288,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 75.386,
   "speechEnd": 80.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "改用大于等于。",
   "spoken": "改用大于等于。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.796,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "speechStart": 81.894,
   "speechEnd": 83.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "TRON 上，每次执行有 80 毫秒的 CPU 时间上限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上，每次执行有 80 毫秒的 CPU 时间上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 84.056,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 84.154,
   "speechEnd": 87.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "以太坊上够用的循环，在 TRON 上可能超时。",
   "spoken": "以太坊上够用的循环，在 TRON 上可能超时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 88.98,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 89.078,
   "speechEnd": 92.185
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "真实案例。2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Akutars NFT。",
   "spoken": "真实案例。2022 年 4 月，以太坊上的 Akutars NFT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 93.256,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 93.354,
   "speechEnd": 98.482
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "它的推送退款，可以被一个拒收合约卡死。",
   "spoken": "它的推送退款，可以被一个拒收合约卡死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 99.548,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 99.646,
   "speechEnd": 102.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "项目方提款的条件，又比较了错误的变量，永远不成立。",
   "spoken": "项目方提款的条件，又比较了错误的变量，永远不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 103.848,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 103.946,
   "speechEnd": 108.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "超过 11539 个 ETH，被永久锁定。",
   "spoken": "超过 11539 个 ETH，被永久锁定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg4-23.mp3",
   "start": 109.156,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 109.254,
   "speechEnd": 112.408
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-24",
   "text": "按 BlockSec 的分析，直接锁死资金的，是第二个缺陷。",
   "spoken": "按 BlockSec 的分析，直接锁死资金的，是第二个缺陷。",
